{"id": "6966a798-6b20-474d-b172-06bb6550a170", "slug": "platform-universe", "title": "Platform Universe", "description": "Platform Universe Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Platform Universe\"\ndescription: \"Platform Universe Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6366F1\"\n  secondary: \"#090C15\"\n  accent: \"#06B6D4\"\n  background: \"#050810\"\n  surface: \"#121726\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"23px\"\n  control: \"23px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform Universe\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 68; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, bento, charts, billing, effect.\n## Overview\nPlatform Universe Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nPlatform Ecosystem An entire universe of components Bypass the boilerplate. We've crafted an expansive library of highly performant interface primitives, meticulously designed and ready to integrate directly into your p…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: An entire universe of components; Massive Component Library; Visual Configuration; Predictable Structure; Built for Any Stack; AI-Native Codebase.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #090C15, accent #06B6D4, background #050810, surface #121726, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Universe</title>\n    \n    <!-- Fonts: Inter for UI -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    \n    <!-- Tailwind CSS Standalone -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    \n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050810] text-slate-400 antialiased min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32 flex flex-col gap-20\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-3xl items-center text-center mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/20 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>Platform Ecosystem</span>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white split-text\">An entire universe of components</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl split-text\">Bypass the boilerplate. We've crafted an expansive library of highly performant interface primitives, meticulously designed and ready to integrate directly into your projects.</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Asymmetrical Grid System -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Component Library (Span 8) -->\n            <article class=\"lg:col-span-8 rounded-3xl p-[1px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 40%, transparent 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-[23px] h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-[#090C15]\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Visual -->\n                    <div class=\"relative h-[280px] flex items-center justify-center border-b border-indigo-500/10 overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-center gap-5 py-8\" style=\"transform: rotate(3deg) scale(1.05); mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 15%, black 85%, transparent); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 15%, black 85%, transparent);\">\n                            \n                            <!-- Track 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"marquee-track flex gap-5 w-max items-center\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/10 bg-indigo-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-indigo-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-3-linear\"></iconify-icon> Dynamic Grids</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-linear\"></iconify-icon> Smart Cursors</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\"></iconify-icon> Data Tables</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/10 bg-cyan-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-cyan-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:text-square-linear\"></iconify-icon> Typography</div>\n                                <!-- Duplicates -->\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/10 bg-indigo-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-indigo-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-3-linear\"></iconify-icon> Dynamic Grids</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-linear\"></iconify-icon> Smart Cursors</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\"></iconify-icon> Data Tables</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/10 bg-cyan-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-cyan-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:text-square-linear\"></iconify-icon> Typography</div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Track 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"marquee-track-reverse flex gap-5 w-max items-center\" style=\"transform: translateX(-15%);\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\"></iconify-icon> Visualizations</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/10 bg-cyan-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-cyan-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-2-linear\"></iconify-icon> Transitions</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clapperboard-play-linear\"></iconify-icon> Scroll Behaviors</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/10 bg-indigo-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-indigo-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-vertical-linear\"></iconify-icon> Native Inputs</div>\n                                <!-- Duplicates -->\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\"></iconify-icon> Visualizations</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/10 bg-cyan-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-cyan-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-2-linear\"></iconify-icon> Transitions</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/5 text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clapperboard-play-linear\"></iconify-icon> Scroll Behaviors</div>\n                                <div class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/10 bg-indigo-500/5 text-sm font-mono text-indigo-200 flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-black/20\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-vertical-linear\"></iconify-icon> Native Inputs</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col justify-end flex-1 z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#090C15] via-[#090C15] to-transparent\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-3 split-text\">Massive Component Library</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed split-text max-w-xl\">Deeply composed micro-interactions, robust layout systems, and stunning visual effects built with native performance in mind. Accelerate your development cycle without sacrificing design fidelity.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Visual Config (Span 4) -->\n            <article class=\"lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-[1px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(225deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 50%, transparent 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-[23px] h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-[#090C15]\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"relative h-[280px] flex items-center justify-center border-b border-white/5 p-8\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[240px] flex flex-col gap-4 float-anim-1 relative z-10\">\n                            <!-- Custom Control UI -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-[#121726] border border-white/10 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-xl\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                    <span>Radius</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-cyan-400\">16px</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-1.5 bg-black/40 rounded-full relative overflow-visible\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[65%] bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-cyan-400 rounded-full\">\n                                        <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full border-[3px] border-[#121726] shadow-sm\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <hr class=\"border-white/5 my-1\">\n                                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400\">Glassmorphism</span>\n                                    <div class=\"w-9 h-5 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full relative p-[2px] cursor-pointer shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.3)]\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full absolute right-[2px] top-[2px]\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col justify-end flex-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-3 split-text\">Visual Configuration</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed split-text\">Adjust physics, spacing, and brand variables visually. Instantly export the tailored utility code directly into your clipboard.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Predictable Structure (Span 5) -->\n            <article class=\"lg:col-span-5 rounded-3xl p-[1px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-[23px] h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-[#090C15]\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"relative h-[240px] flex items-center p-8 overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Abstract Structure Art -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,1) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\"></div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"relative w-full flex flex-col gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 float-anim-2 pl-4 border-l-2 border-indigo-500/20\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-indigo-300\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-with-files-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span>/core-ui</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 pl-6 border-l border-white/5 ml-2 mt-1\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span>/primitives</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 pl-6 border-l border-white/5 ml-2 mt-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-code-linear\" class=\"text-base text-cyan-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span>BentoGrid.tsx</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-500\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-code-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span>Card.tsx</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span>/hooks</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-end flex-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-3 split-text\">Predictable Structure</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed split-text\">Flat, logical directory hierarchies. Locate exactly the surface, layout component, or animation utility you require in seconds.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Built for Any Stack (Span 7) -->\n            <article class=\"lg:col-span-7 rounded-3xl p-[1px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1) 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-[23px] h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-[#090C15]\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"relative h-[240px] flex items-center justify-center p-8 overflow-hidden\">\n                        \n                        <!-- Connecting Nodes -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[400px] h-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            \n                            <!-- Bezier Connection Lines -->\n                            <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full text-indigo-500/20\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 240\">\n                                <path d=\"M200 120 C 140 120, 100 70, 70 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" class=\"dash-anim\" />\n                                <path d=\"M200 120 C 260 120, 300 70, 330 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" class=\"dash-anim\" />\n                                <path d=\"M200 120 C 140 120, 100 170, 70 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" class=\"dash-anim\" />\n                                <path d=\"M200 120 C 260 120, 300 170, 330 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" class=\"dash-anim\" />\n                            </svg>\n\n                            <!-- Core Hub -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute z-10 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E293B] to-[#0F172A] border border-slate-700 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(99,102,241,0.15)] flex items-center justify-center pulse-hub\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" class=\"text-white text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Endpoints -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-[54px] left-[30px] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 float-anim-1 backdrop-blur-sm\">React / Next.js</div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-[54px] right-[30px] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 float-anim-2 backdrop-blur-sm\">Vue / Nuxt</div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[54px] left-[30px] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 float-anim-2 backdrop-blur-sm\">Tailwind CSS</div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[54px] right-[30px] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 float-anim-1 backdrop-blur-sm\">Vanilla JS</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-end flex-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-3 split-text\">Built for Any Stack</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed split-text\">Engineered natively for modern JavaScript frameworks, alongside robust HTML/CSS variants. Zero bloat, zero strict dependencies dictating your stack choices.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 5: AI Native (Span 6) -->\n            <article class=\"lg:col-span-6 rounded-3xl p-[1px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-[23px] h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-[#090C15]\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"relative h-[260px] flex items-center justify-center p-8 overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);\">\n                        \n                        <!-- Terminal Design -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[420px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#020408]/80 backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-[160px]\">\n                            <div class=\"h-10 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] flex items-center px-4 gap-2\">\n                                <div class=\"flex gap-1.5 mr-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\">ai-agent.sh</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 font-mono text-xs h-full\">\n                                <div class=\"text-slate-400 flex gap-3\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-cyan-500/50\">❯</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-300\">Generate a masonry grid with stagger</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-slate-400 flex gap-3\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-indigo-400/50\">⚡</span>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <span class=\"text-cyan-300 ai-typewriter\"></span><span class=\"w-1.5 h-3.5 bg-cyan-400 ml-0.5 inline-block align-middle cursor-blink\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-end flex-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-3 split-text\">AI-Native Codebase</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed split-text\">Highly semantic syntax and extremely predictable property APIs mean LLMs like GitHub Copilot can construct intricate interfaces flawlessly on the first try.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 6: Momentum (Span 6) -->\n            <article class=\"lg:col-span-6 rounded-3xl p-[1px] relative group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(315deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2) 0%, transparent 60%);\" id=\"momentum-card\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-[23px] h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-[#090C15]\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"relative h-[260px] flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden pt-10\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"px-8 z-10 flex flex-col gap-2 absolute top-8 left-0\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rocket-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Developer Usage\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white\" id=\"momentum-counter\">0</div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Smooth Area Chart -->\n                        <svg class=\"w-full h-[140px]\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 120\">\n                            <defs>\n                                <linearGradient id=\"chart-area-fill\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2)\" />\n                                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"rgba(99, 102, 241, 0)\" />\n                                </linearGradient>\n                            </defs>\n                            <path class=\"chart-area opacity-0\" d=\"M0,120 L0,90 C 100,90, 150,50, 250,60 C 320,65, 360,20, 400,10 L400,120 Z\" fill=\"url(#chart-area-fill)\" />\n                            <path class=\"chart-stroke\" d=\"M0,90 C 100,90, 150,50, 250,60 C 320,65, 360,20, 400,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.6)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\n                        </svg>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-end flex-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-3 split-text\">Community Momentum</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed split-text\">Trusted by thousands of frontend engineers globally to elevate their product experiences. The fastest adopted UI standard of the year.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- Skill Directive: Masked Word Reveal Logic ---\n            function initMaskedReveal() {\n                const elements = document.querySelectorAll('.split-text');\n                \n                elements.forEach(el => {\n                    const text = el.innerText;\n                    const words = text.split(' ');\n                    el.innerHTML = '';\n                    \n                    words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                        // Outer wrapper for the mask\n                        const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                        wrapper.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                        wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                        wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                        // Use inline styles closely matching the required masking behavior\n                        wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.15em'; \n                        wrapper.style.marginBottom = '-0.15em'; \n                        if (index < words.length - 1) wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                        \n                        // Inner text block to animate\n                        const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                        inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        inner.style.transform = 'translateY(120%)';\n                        inner.innerText = word;\n                        inner.className = 'reveal-word-inner';\n                        \n                        wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                        el.appendChild(wrapper);\n                    });\n\n                    // Trigger GSAP stagger\n                    gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word-inner'), {\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: \"top 92%\",\n                            toggleActions: \"play none none none\"\n                        },\n                        y: \"0%\",\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        stagger: 0.04,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\"\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n\n            // --- Card 1: Marquee Animations ---\n            gsap.to(\".marquee-track\", {\n                xPercent: -50,\n                duration: 35,\n                ease: \"linear\",\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n            gsap.to(\".marquee-track-reverse\", {\n                xPercent: 50,\n                duration: 40,\n                ease: \"linear\",\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // --- Floating & Pulse Animations ---\n            gsap.to(\".float-anim-1\", {\n                y: \"-=8\",\n                duration: 3,\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"power1.inOut\"\n            });\n            gsap.to(\".float-anim-2\", {\n                y: \"+=8\",\n                duration: 3.5,\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"power1.inOut\"\n            });\n            gsap.to(\".pulse-hub\", {\n                scale: 1.05,\n                boxShadow: \"0 0 60px rgba(99,102,241,0.25)\",\n                duration: 2.5,\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n            gsap.to(\".dash-anim\", {\n                strokeDashoffset: -24,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"linear\",\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // --- Cursor Blink ---\n            gsap.to(\".cursor-blink\", {\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 0.5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"steps(1)\"\n            });\n\n            // --- Card 5: AI Typewriter Simulation ---\n            const codeString = 'import { Masonry } from \"@/ui\";';\n            const aiTypeEl = document.querySelector('.ai-typewriter');\n            let charIndex = 0;\n            \n            function runTypewriter() {\n                if (charIndex < codeString.length) {\n                    const char = codeString.charAt(charIndex);\n                    aiTypeEl.innerHTML += char === '<' ? '&lt;' : char === '>' ? '&gt;' : char;\n                    charIndex++;\n                    setTimeout(runTypewriter, 50 + Math.random() * 50);\n                } else {\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        aiTypeEl.innerHTML = '';\n                        charIndex = 0;\n                        runTypewriter();\n                    }, 5000);\n                }\n            }\n\n            ScrollTrigger.create({\n                trigger: \".ai-typewriter\",\n                start: \"top 90%\",\n                onEnter: () => setTimeout(runTypewriter, 500),\n                once: true\n            });\n\n            // --- Card 6: Momentum Chart Animation ---\n            const chartStroke = document.querySelector('.chart-stroke');\n            const pathLen = chartStroke.getTotalLength();\n            \n            gsap.set(chartStroke, { strokeDasharray: pathLen, strokeDashoffset: pathLen });\n            \n            let countProxy = { val: 0 };\n            \n            ScrollTrigger.create({\n                trigger: \"#momentum-card\",\n                start: \"top 80%\",\n                onEnter: () => {\n                    // Counter\n                    gsap.to(countProxy, {\n                        val: 124.5,\n                        duration: 3.5,\n                        ease: \"power3.out\",\n                        onUpdate: function() {\n                            document.getElementById('momentum-counter').innerText = this.targets()[0].val.toFixed(1) + 'k';\n                        }\n                    });\n\n                    // Stroke reveal\n                    gsap.to(chartStroke, {\n                        strokeDashoffset: 0,\n                        duration: 2.5,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\"\n                    });\n\n                    // Area fade-in\n                    gsap.to('.chart-area', {\n                        opacity: 1,\n                        duration: 2,\n                        ease: \"power1.inOut\",\n                        delay: 0.5\n                    });\n                },\n                once: true\n            });\n\n            // Initialize all text masks\n            initMaskedReveal();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-universe.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/platform-universe.jpg", "source_name": "platform-universe-DESIGN.md", "views": 89, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T17:12:41.336384+00:00"}